# Candidate F4 (issue 172, near top-down): a gramophone in the stand's own viewpoint. The front faces north (a plain oak strip along the top); the platter sits on the oak top at the left and a brass horn lies along the top at the right, narrow where it leaves the box at the north and flaring wide toward the wall (south), its dark mouth at the back. 16x16.
size: 16x16
